# Hello, Web4 from npm

Install the package and call `greet()` to generate a greeting.

```js
export function greet(name = "world") {
  if (typeof name !== "string" || name.trim() === "") {
    throw new TypeError("name must be a non-empty string");
  }

  return `Hello, ${name.trim()}!`;
}
```

## Usage

```js
import { greet } from "@web4hub/hello-world";

console.log(greet("Web4"));
```
